This proves basic artifact readability and contractual markers. It does not prove:

- correct engineering values,
- correct units,
- correct formulas,
- correct source mapping,
- correct table semantics,
- visual layout correctness,
- absence of unsafe recommendations,
- approval authority,
- document tamper resistance.

