10.2 Sandbox status

The sandbox has real namespace probing and unshare command construction:

- rust/crates/runtime/src/sandbox.rs:155-206
- rust/crates/runtime/src/sandbox.rs:211-260

But the implementation is not an OS-grade isolation boundary.

Critical fail-open path

When a sandbox launcher cannot be constructed:

let mut prepared = Command::new("sh");
prepared.arg("-lc").arg(command)

in rust/crates/runtime/src/bash.rs:306-320 and the Tokio equivalent at 334-347.

