11.3 Sovereignty conclusion

The system can be configured to operate locally, but the repository does not prove or centrally enforce local-only operation.

A jury should not be told “the system is air-gapped” based on current code. The accurate statement is:

▎ “The architecture supports a local deployment, but the current software does not enforce network-deny-by-default or fail closed when isolation is unavailable.”

