14.3 Maximum complete end-to-end workflow today

The maximum honest workflow is:

1. Use a synthetic Markdown inspection report.
2. Call the local industrial demo MCP server.
3. Search synthetic Markdown via keyword matching.
4. Generate a synthetic approval-note DOCX.
5. Generate a synthetic PPTX from a structured plan.
6. Verify required text markers and attempt LibreOffice rendering.
7. Require human review before operational use.

The maximum complete workflow is not:

Scanned industrial PDF
→ OCR
→ layout/P&ID understanding
→ MRPL RAG
→ engineering reasoning
→ verified calculation
→ signed approval artifact

That workflow is not currently supported.

