- rootless containers or microVMs,
- dedicated GPU nodes,
- 64–128 GB RAM per inference node depending on model,
- encrypted local storage,
- separate knowledge and workspace volumes,
- network ACLs allowing only explicitly approved local services,
- no default Internet route,
- auditable identity and approval service,
- backup and recovery plan,
- pinned model/container artifacts,
- controlled update mirror.

The current repository does not contain this deployment hardening.

