- Artifacts look good but lack semantic verification.
- Sandbox is described as present but not demonstrated under failure.
- Tests are mostly unit-level.
- Corpus is synthetic and narrow.

26.3 What would make the evaluator say NO?

- Remote/cloud model used in the sovereign demo.
- No answer about outbound network paths.
- Claims of VLM/OCR/RAG unsupported by logs.
- Shell execution runs on the host.
- No real document ingestion.
- No provenance or source citations.
- Synthetic output presented as operational approval.
- Crashes or broken tests during the demo.

